{"4316870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Captain VKing", "steam_appid": 4316870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5129080], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316870/extras/efb12043e92c7cc87e7eee092bb5bf51.poster.avif?t=1787048314\" width=700 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316870/extras/efb12043e92c7cc87e7eee092bb5bf51.webm?t=1787048314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316870/extras/efb12043e92c7cc87e7eee092bb5bf51.mp4?t=1787048314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316870/extras/f2b08c482bd637b93dc46e6d3abf9ef6.poster.avif?t=1787048314\" width=700 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316870/extras/f2b08c482bd637b93dc46e6d3abf9ef6.webm?t=1787048314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316870/extras/f2b08c482bd637b93dc46e6d3abf9ef6.mp4?t=1787048314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the fractured edges of the galaxy, survival isn't free—you have to mine it. Step into the boots of Captain VKing, a royal bounty hunter riding a custom-tuned rocket into the lawless void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your targets are relentless, infinite swarms of high-value targets. Your rocket is a modular combat craft built for a hunter who doesn't miss. With razor-sharp handling and a weapon grid designed for rapid arcade action, you’ll track, ambush, and obliterate enemy formations across the shifting cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shattered target is a resource. Every wave is a fight for your life. Every run is a chance to carve your legend into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy doesn’t need a hero—it needs a royal hunter with a rocket. Lock on. Boost in. Collect the bounty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Crafting Arsenal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the bullet hell into your personal forge. Mine shattered enemies for raw materials to craft modular tools, reinforce your rocket's plating, and engineer critical tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival‑Driven Void</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure hostile space environments, manage your resources, and navigate cosmic hazards as you hunt across a brutal galaxy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Shooter Combat Flow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, kinetic 2D battles where precision dodging, timed bursts, and shattering enemy formations test your reflexes and keep the pressure high.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316870/extras/efb12043e92c7cc87e7eee092bb5bf51.poster.avif?t=1787048314\" width=700 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316870/extras/efb12043e92c7cc87e7eee092bb5bf51.webm?t=1787048314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316870/extras/efb12043e92c7cc87e7eee092bb5bf51.mp4?t=1787048314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316870/extras/f2b08c482bd637b93dc46e6d3abf9ef6.poster.avif?t=1787048314\" width=700 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316870/extras/f2b08c482bd637b93dc46e6d3abf9ef6.webm?t=1787048314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316870/extras/f2b08c482bd637b93dc46e6d3abf9ef6.mp4?t=1787048314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the fractured edges of the galaxy, survival isn't free—you have to mine it. Step into the boots of Captain VKing, a royal bounty hunter riding a custom-tuned rocket into the lawless void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your targets are relentless, infinite swarms of high-value targets. Your rocket is a modular combat craft built for a hunter who doesn't miss. With razor-sharp handling and a weapon grid designed for rapid arcade action, you’ll track, ambush, and obliterate enemy formations across the shifting cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shattered target is a resource. Every wave is a fight for your life. Every run is a chance to carve your legend into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy doesn’t need a hero—it needs a royal hunter with a rocket. Lock on. Boost in. Collect the bounty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Crafting Arsenal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the bullet hell into your personal forge. Mine shattered enemies for raw materials to craft modular tools, reinforce your rocket's plating, and engineer critical tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival‑Driven Void</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure hostile space environments, manage your resources, and navigate cosmic hazards as you hunt across a brutal galaxy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Shooter Combat Flow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, kinetic 2D battles where precision dodging, timed bursts, and shattering enemy formations test your reflexes and keep the pressure high.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Blast, hunt, mine, craft, survive. Gear up for Captain Vking, a 2D survival crafting space shooter where every defeated enemy is a resource. As a cosmic bounty hunter, obliterate endless swarms of enemies, mine the debris, and craft powerful tools to survive the unforgiving void.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316870/0ebec871f1e78324d92fcf4b08cd4c235ef70424/header.jpg?t=1787048314", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316870/eb09a0f84aaf8b497c08d90b8f686d77cd3a98ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787048314", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316870/eb09a0f84aaf8b497c08d90b8f686d77cd3a98ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787048314", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.0 compatible graphics card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.0 compatible graphics card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements